Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,D-Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Somebody died...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's so funny about it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My dad died!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're all... crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The people from Ebisu Town are always smiling...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...because even when they're hurt or sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...they can't let it show on their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All facial expressions other than a smile\Nwere taken away from them...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and now, all they can do is laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.89,0:03:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because of what Kaido and Orochi\Nbrought here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a fruit called Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.41,0:03:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"Toko's Tears!\NOrochi's Pitiless Bullets!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Smile fruit is more than just an artificial Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:04:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonoyasu got...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn! We were too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How could not I recognize him\Nuntil he was tied up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a blunder.\NI should commit seppuku...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.89,0:05:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.24,0:05:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonoyasu-{\i1}san{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie-{\i1}sama{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He died!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:06:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.15,0:06:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The people from Ebisu Town\Nloved him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are they laughing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Orochi has a sick sense of humor...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They must be crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're laughing at\Nthe execution of their former Daimyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Orochi's so cruel...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie-{\i1}dono{\i0}...\NI can't believe he was alive until today...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:07:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So the enemy knew about our raid plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is why you... Yasuie-{\i1}dono{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You sacrificed yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...to keep the plan safe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There must be a reason, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter who he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.22,0:07:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No one in this world deserves to be laughed at...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...as they die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.27,0:07:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's probably because of the Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.07,0:07:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can find some of those people\Nwho can only laugh here, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:07:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dogstorm, Kin'emon...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you guys know about the Smile fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I should have... told you earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The smiling faces of Ebisu Town's people...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...are merely masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.09,0:08:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Masks that can't be taken off...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...for the rest of their lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A few years ago, Kaido and Orochi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...started importing some kind of artificial fruit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...in exchange for the weapons\Nthat are made in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Smile fruit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:09:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you eat that horrible fruit,\Nthe sea will hate you and you'll lose the ability to swim,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.61,0:09:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but in return, you'll gain the ability of an animal\Nand it'll make you ferocious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's an artificial Devil Fruit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We destroyed the factory\Nthat was making them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.18,0:09:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Kin-{\i1}sama{\i0} told me about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But tons of them had already been\Nbrought into the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaido's objective was to make his subordinates stronger\Nlike ferocious beasts with that fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and build the world's greatest pirate group!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But there is always a catch to\Nsomething that's too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The success rate of that artificial strength enhancer\Nwas about 10 percent...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:10:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If 10 people ate that fruit,\Nonly one of them would gain the ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.63,0:10:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The other nine won't see any improvement\Nand will face only the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, they won't be able to swim again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As the side effects of the defective chemicals,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.32,0:10:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,they won't be able to express their sorrow or anger.\NThey'll only be able to laugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The key ingredient of the Smile is\NSAD that Caesar was making, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.49,0:10:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That has a terrible side effect like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaido doesn't care about his subordinates' safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.43,0:10:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He just wants strong soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.55,0:11:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The combatants of the Animal Kingdom Pirates\Nare grouped into three categories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those who haven't eaten and are waiting\Nfor a chance to gain an animal ability...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...are the Waiters!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The tough ones who obtained animal abilities\Nfrom a one-in-ten chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...are the Gifters!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The laughing fighters who ate the fruit,\Nbut failed to gain abilities...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...are the Pleasures!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.92,0:11:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then as if they mock those unlucky ones\Nwho couldn't gain any ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,they named the artificial fruit\Nafter those soldiers' facial expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.27,0:11:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Namely, a "Smile"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's where the name "Smile" came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.87,0:11:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's artificial,\NI thought it was a weird name for a Devil Fruit...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The tragedy only begins there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Orochi took notice of\Nthose failed Smiles that were bitten once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They still harbored bad side effects,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so they could produce more Pleasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In the town of leftovers outside the Flower Capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,people were dying every day and crying out in hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And Orochi couldn't stand it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so he mixed those failed Smiles in\Nwith the leftovers from the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There are apples! They're still fresh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, let's share!\NThese will be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.89,0:13:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After the first few times,\Nanyone would figure out...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...what kind of fruit it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But the townspeople...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...couldn't hold back their hunger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is how Ebisu Town\Nwhere everyone is smiling and cheerful...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...was made.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The tragic town where everyone looks happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but they cannot even grieve over the death of their parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.49,0:14:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...please do not blame... those laughing people...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Amongst all the species,\Nonly humans can laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.98,0:14:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If that's true, why not laugh, laugh?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.83,0:15:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.68,0:15:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Shogun Orochi's heaviest sin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He made people's lives miserable...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and even forbade them to grieve!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...this is not hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.71,0:15:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...then what is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zorojuro-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You got the death you deserved, Yasuie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.94,0:16:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasu-{\i1}san{\i0} passed away...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I cannot believe how impudent he was\Nto survive in my Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.99,0:16:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You were so rude, Hedgehog!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I mean, Sewer Rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is right, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.67,0:17:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shimotsuki Yasuie, Hakumai's former Daimyo\Nthat you loved has died!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.73,0:17:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Send him off with the sound of your laughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the Land of Wano!\NThe cheerful Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is just like heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Laugh! Laugh more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toko?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.65,0:17:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toko!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, Toko! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.38,0:18:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have good medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That girl! She came to eat soba...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Otoko-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess she's Tonoyasu's daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.99,0:18:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:19:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This medicine will heal your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's called toad oil\Nand it works super well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Otoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.47,0:19:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! That medicine is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hiyori-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.69,0:19:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, Toko! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.28,0:19:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There you are, you damn brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.97,0:20:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see... So you are Yasuie's daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.35,0:20:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That explains why you are so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.48,0:20:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you... If you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.35,0:20:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...did not laugh like an idiot at that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.85,0:20:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Komurasaki would not have had to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.93,0:20:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.87,0:20:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Both you and your father are driving me crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.75,0:21:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come back, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will execute you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.55,0:21:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to hell! You little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.81,0:21:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Otoko, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I do not want to lose you as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Disappear from my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.45,0:22:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those are...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.64,0:22:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The wanted man who killed the magistrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:38.50,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,WANTED - ZOROJURO
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.71,0:22:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the soba cook who stood against the Kyoshiro Family!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:44.01,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,WANTED - SANGORO
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.89,0:23:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}To take down their formidable enemy,\Nthe Straw Hats keep fighting!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.98,0:23:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sanji bravely fights back against fierce attacks\Nfrom Drake of the Worst Generation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}In anger, Zoro takes a slice\Nat Kyoshiro who stands in his way!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.36,0:23:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thunder roars and each of the Straw Hats shows\Ntheir great technique!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.36,0:23:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Will they be able to\Nbreak through Orochi's encircling forces?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece! "The Straw Hats Step In!\NAn Uproarious Deadly Battle at the Execution Ground!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.33,0:23:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.19,0:23:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.19,0:23:49.19,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
